# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Columns and breaks (live mode)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
{columns: 2}
{column_break}
{start_of_verse: After a column break}
[G]{column_break} starts a new column in live mode.
{end_of_verse}
{new_page}
{start_of_verse: After a page break}
[C]{new_page} also starts a new column on screen.
{end_of_verse}

{new_song}
{title: Second Song in the Same File}
{artist: The RealChord Band}
{key: D}
{tag: Test}

